What:		/config/usb-gadget/gadget/functions/rndis.name
Date:		Jun 2013
KernelVersion:	3.11
Description:
		The attributes:

		=========	=============================================
		ifname		network device interface name associated with
				this function instance
		qmult		queue length multiplier for high and
				super speed
		host_addr	MAC address of host's end of this
				Ethernet over USB link
		dev_addr	MAC address of device's end of this
				Ethernet over USB link
		class		USB interface class, default is 02 (hex)
		subclass	USB interface subclass, default is 06 (hex)
		protocol	USB interface protocol, default is 00 (hex)
		ifunction	optional iFunction string (max 95 characters)
				for the Interface Association Descriptor.
				When set, it replaces the built-in strings and
				the interfaces report no iInterface string
		=========	=============================================

		If class, subclass or protocol differ from their defaults,
		the values are also reported in the control interface
		descriptor, not only in the Interface Association Descriptor.
